                                "example_id": "495e2581-67fb-4011-bd7a-04e843fc1c24",
                                "sense_id": "7ff4b5a0-c52e-3978-846c-85a7fd1436b4",
                                "text": "\"Fine,\" said Blanche, \"but 'Maude' sounds anything but continental.\"\n\"Suppose we change her name to 'Meredith Meredro',\" I suggested."
